    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-4730380898db0cabe703dbe1",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "通过调节常数 K、K_P 和 K_I 可以改善暂态性能以满足系统性能指标，这或许最好通过根轨迹法来实现：在 s 平面上确定零点 s=-K_I/K_P 的位置后，绘制针对增益 K_P K 的根轨迹。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "The transient performance can be adjusted to satisfy the system specifications by adjusting the constants K, K_P, and K_I, perhaps best accomplished by using root locus methods and drawing a root locus for the gain K_P K after locating the zero s=-K_I/K_P on the s-plane.",
